{"4168740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Sector: Outbreak", "steam_appid": 4168740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious outbreak tore through the world, survivors fled to remote regions — but even here, the infected roam the dunes, ruins, and abandoned crash sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the desert expanse, scavenge wreckage buried beneath drifting sand, and <strong>build your own shelter</strong> to withstand the threats hiding in the heat haze.<br>Resources are scarce, the land is unforgiving, and every journey into the open can be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft improvised gear, fortify your hideout, and navigate a world where rusted metal, old billboards, and broken machines are all that remain of the past.<br>But the infected aren’t the only danger — the wasteland itself tests your resilience at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Building &amp; Defense: Construct shelters, fortresses, and traps to survive against escalating waves of infected.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Survival: Manage hunger, thirst, fatigue, and injuries in a hostile environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-World Exploration: Scavenge towns, laboratories, and abandoned military outposts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Day &amp; Night Cycle: Darkness brings greater dangers and deadlier encounters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Crafting System: Forge weapons, tools, and medicine from whatever you can find.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious outbreak tore through the wor